# NOTICE

Third-party material compiled into the `jwc` binary, and where its licence
text lives. Distributed with every release beside the binary and the
`.sha256` files.

## Vendored, in this repository

| | Version | Licence | Text |
|---|---|---|---|
| [Swagger UI](https://github.com/swagger-api/swagger-ui) | 5.33.1 | Apache-2.0 | [`vendor/swagger-ui/LICENSE`](vendor/swagger-ui/LICENSE) |

Three files — `swagger-ui-bundle.js`, `swagger-ui-standalone-preset.js` and
`swagger-ui.css` — stored gzipped under `vendor/swagger-ui/` and served
